ery single day</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/508892200409759594/comments/default/6719663960523171629'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/508892200409759594/comments/default/6719663960523171629'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/03/finicums-wake.html?showComment=1458985908031#c6719663960523171629' title=''/><link rel='related' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/508892200409759594/comments/default/7711043549586364311'/><author><name>tammy Ikonen</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14001025840719804508</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='32' src='//lh5.googleusercontent.com/-7mwllEqMrH4/AAAAAAAAAAI/AAAAAAAAy2E/g5xBZsBi6I4/s512-c/photo.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/03/finicums-wake.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-508892200409759594' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/508892200409759594' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1926770336"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="March 26, 2016 at 3:51 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-686939575185497856</id><published>2016-03-26T03:46:01.076-06:00</published><updated>2016-03-26T03:46:01.076-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I watched this particular weed for the first time ...</title><content type='html'>I watched this particular weed for the first time tonight. As I watched horrified my heart pounding my pulse racing my tears begin to stream knowing what would be coming up soon and I screamed and I screamed out loud   terrified terrified for the individuals left in the vehicle the horror experience the t